{"4639510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "JIRO", "steam_appid": 4639510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639510/extras/1b61a4004a3930dc301992cd3daf9763.avif?t=1777455145\" width=700 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>An epic story driven action adventure game</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As JIRO, a lonely boy with a tragic past, you will explore a big and mysterious world. Along the way, <strong>you will discover old secrets, fight strong enemies, and solve enigmatic puzzles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JIRO is a teenager trying to find his place in a world that’s falling apart.</strong> He doesn’t see himself as a hero, just a boy trying to survive in a dangerous world he doesn’t fully understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But everything changes when he finds a mysterious old artifact, an ancient gauntlet with strange powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This gauntlet once belonged to <strong>the King</strong>, a powerful ruler who now controls the land with fear. It was a symbol of his strength, until it disappeared. Now that JIRO has it, the King will do anything to get it back, believing it’s the key to keeping his power forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639510/extras/8c2147aafae1979eff6ca3a3881e5daf.poster.avif?t=1777455145\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639510/extras/8c2147aafae1979eff6ca3a3881e5daf.webm?t=1777455145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639510/extras/8c2147aafae1979eff6ca3a3881e5daf.mp4?t=1777455145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639510/extras/74240b0ff05d0b45d3d66542e6039f43.avif?t=1777455145\" width=700 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with the <strong>ancient gauntlet</strong>, JIRO unlocks powerful abilities that grow stronger the more you play. You’ll need to think, adapt your tactics, and use your surroundings to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639510/extras/ee597f66d5f2afb9ec9e01e402a60746.poster.avif?t=1777455145\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639510/extras/ee597f66d5f2afb9ec9e01e402a60746.webm?t=1777455145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639510/extras/ee597f66d5f2afb9ec9e01e402a60746.mp4?t=1777455145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Key features of the combat:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic, skill-based melee combat</strong> with parries, dodge and light, heavy, and combo attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will unlock new abilities and skills</strong> that let you manipulate the environment and discover new areas, unleash devastating attacks or help you with tricky puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced enemy AI</strong> that forces you to read patterns, dodge precisely, and strike when the moment is right.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each epic boss encounter is unique, </strong>each with its own mechanics and weaknesses you’ll need to figure out to win.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639510/extras/e5838f3288f96217ce7e27f9d33c80be.poster.avif?t=1777455145\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639510/extras/e5838f3288f96217ce7e27f9d33c80be.webm?t=1777455145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639510/extras/e5838f3288f96217ce7e27f9d33c80be.mp4?t=1777455145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639510/extras/14030f19291e5ea361d93c55aa77ec56.avif?t=1777455145\" width=700 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Exploration is key in JIRO, You'll discover breathtaking landscapes that reward curiosity.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb cliffs to discover new locations, dive into underwater caves hiding <strong>lost treasures</strong>, or stumble upon hidden ancient <strong>ruins and temples</strong> that whisper tales of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639510/extras/957ba67fa7fd7f005c8ba46458007b35.poster.avif?t=1777455145\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639510/extras/957ba67fa7fd7f005c8ba46458007b35.webm?t=1777455145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639510/extras/957ba67fa7fd7f005c8ba46458007b35.mp4?t=1777455145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639510/extras/5a91a07eef369ff137ade38fd68d1c9a.avif?t=1777455145\" width=700 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Each puzzle offers a challenge and pulls you deeper into the world.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solving a puzzle will help you find powerful items, unlock secret places, and learn more about JIRO, his story, and promising legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639510/extras/481a338fccb981a4b17e5fe1872a0346.poster.avif?t=1777455145\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639510/extras/481a338fccb981a4b17e5fe1872a0346.webm?t=1777455145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639510/extras/481a338fccb981a4b17e5fe1872a0346.mp4?t=1777455145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster